1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,688
My shadow just tried to choke me on the kitchen floor. It is getting heavier every single day.

2
00:00:05,988 --> 00:00:12,252
At first, I thought it was just a trick of the evening light. A strange angle from the streetlamp outside.

3
00:00:12,552 --> 00:00:19,248
Then it started pulling downward. Dragging me toward the floor like a lead weight stitched to my heels.

4
00:00:19,548 --> 00:00:26,172
I went to the doctor, but the scale showed nothing. My body is light, but my outline is sinking.

5
00:00:26,472 --> 00:00:34,656
Last night, the shadow grew hands. It reached out and grabbed my ankles, refusing to let me cross the room.

6
00:00:34,956 --> 00:00:40,572
I finally figured out what it wants. It is keeping score of every time I turned my back.

7
00:00:40,872 --> 00:00:47,760
Every stranger I ignored on the subway. Every friend I walked away from when they needed help.

8
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:54,180
The silhouette is no longer mine. It is made of all the people I pretended I could not see.

9
00:00:54,480 --> 00:01:01,488
Now I cannot lift my feet at all. The floorboards are splintering, and I am sinking into the dark.

10
00:01:01,788 --> 00:01:08,868
My shadow just tried to choke me, and I realized I built the weight myself. Will yours let you walk away?
